    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>布鲁克纳第六交响曲，于1879至1881年创作。</span></p><p><span>这期节目，与最爱第六交响曲的雪原一起边听边聊。使用布鲁克纳第六录音是罗格纳指挥柏林广播交响乐团。</span></p><p><a href="https://xiang.bwv988.com/share/track/330783621/330783663" data-url="https://xiang.bwv988.com/share/track/330783621/330783663"><span>录音链接</span></a></p><p><span>相关单集</span></p><p><span>👉 布三 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6032475ed622bfcedf70d205?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6032475ed622bfcedf70d205?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9"><span>上</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60420bfc33e6d1ca16a167c9?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60420bfc33e6d1ca16a167c9?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9"><span>下</span></a></p><p><span>👉 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6681f77f077b88831b50feb3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6681f77f077b88831b50feb3"><span>布四</span></a></p><p><span>👉 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d8ab11513a776b57a010ff" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d8ab11513a776b57a010ff"><span>布五</span></a></p><p><span>👉 布七 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/614449ecfad84987c817f449?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/614449ecfad84987c817f449?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9"><span>上（Adagio）</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6183bbfc510bc7726577a025?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6183bbfc510bc7726577a025?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmYTYwZjljZTBmNWU3MjNiYmU0NjE3YSJ9"><span>下</span></a></p><p><span>👉 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f6a90de490c5dee560a547" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f6a90de490c5dee560a547"><span>论布八的尾声</span></a></p><p><span>👉 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63a1390ee7ab859986035416" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63a1390ee7ab859986035416"><span>布九慢乐章</span></a></p><p><span>请关注「响声App」微信公众号，即日起会周更全国各地区演出日历</span></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VanoIN1zW3BrXmA2x-sckQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VanoIN1zW3BrXmA2x-sckQ"><span>江浙沪</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lafWPciGNNZJfzodTQe8_Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lafWPciGNNZJfzodTQe8_Q"><span>京津冀</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U-FNfuR7KI_5hDTfocAgIQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U-FNfuR7KI_5hDTfocAgIQ"><span>大湾区</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/blC2sLGrA-cAvUMyJlJnVQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/blC2sLGrA-cAvUMyJlJnVQ"><span>川渝和其他主要城市</span></a></p><p></p>]]></description>
