  <item>
    <title>乐圣也是器材党？从贝多芬的八首钢琴奏鸣曲看钢琴的进化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac87c5e195d838e2aef1de4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac87c5e195d838e2aef1de4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 05:41:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>节目里提到的图片、谱例等请滑动到shownote底部</span></p><p><span>本期音乐播单</span><br><a href="https://music.apple.com/cn/playlist/%E8%B4%9D%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%AC%E7%9A%84%E9%92%A2%E7%90%B4%E4%BB%AC-beethoven-on-early-pianos/pl.u-l2PRTdN9KRZ" data-url="https://music.apple.com/cn/playlist/%E8%B4%9D%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%AC%E7%9A%84%E9%92%A2%E7%90%B4%E4%BB%AC-beethoven-on-early-pianos/pl.u-l2PRTdN9KRZ"><span>Apple Music</span></a></p><p><span>响声App内相关专题</span></p><p><a href="https://xiang.bwv988.com/share/editorial/not-the-piano-youre-hearing" data-url="https://xiang.bwv988.com/share/editorial/not-the-piano-youre-hearing"><span>早期钢琴130年</span></a></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> 《华德斯坦》Piano Sonata in C Major, No. 21, Op. 53_ I. Allegro con brio（Tom Beghin，比利时制琴家克里斯·马内照着贝多芬那台埃拉尔复制的琴）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 无编号《选帝侯奏鸣曲》Piano Sonata in E-Flat Major, WoO 47（Ronald Brautigam，麦克纳尔蒂仿制的一台 1788 年施泰因钢琴）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 第七奏鸣曲 Piano Sonata No. 7 in D Major, Op. 10 No. 3:（Ronald Brautigam，麦克纳尔蒂仿制的一台约 1802 年瓦尔特钢琴）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a> 《月光》Sonata No. 14 (Quasi una fantasia) in C-Sharp Minor, Op. 27 No. 2（Malcolm Bilson，维也纳式古钢琴）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2997">49:57</a> 《暴风雨》Piano Sonata No. 17 in D Minor, Op. 31 No. 2（Alexei Lubimov，克里斯托弗·克拉克为巴黎音乐博物馆仿制的 1802 年埃拉尔，和海顿那台是同一家作坊、同一个年代的琴）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4038">67:18</a> 海顿C大调奏鸣曲， Hob.XVI 50 "The English"（Pletnev）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4459">74:19</a> 《华德斯坦》Piano Sonata in C Major, No. 21, Op. 53_ I. Allegro con brio（Tom Beghin，比利时制琴家克里斯·马内照着贝多芬那台埃拉尔复制的琴）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5418">90:18</a> 《热情》Piano Sonata in F Minor, No. 23, Op. 57（Tom Beghin，同上）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5841">97:21</a> 《槌子键琴》Piano Sonata No. 29 in B-Flat Major, Op. 106, Hammerklavier（Ronald Brautigam，早期钢琴复制琴）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6726">112:06</a> 《六首小品》第二首 Six Bagatelles Op.126 (1823-1824)（András Schiff，修复的那台贝多芬的布罗德伍德钢琴）</span></p><p><span>以下是满老师课件</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSBR_KKq1_Ul3ksFyc4SihmUB1g.jpg"></figure><p><span>Fortepiano Stein（斯泰因古钢琴）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVgnqAwrZyxHYlGsNdvvJsid1yI.jpg"></figure><p><span>Clavichord（击弦古钢琴）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKjsCNnvbf716ue8SMBgfGpVTqr.jpg"></figure><p><span>Walter 1790（瓦尔特）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkWMh_rMjN_iCJHI-1yxF_1TJOAP.jpg"></figure><p><span>分段制音（split/divided damper）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhvRhQ72pegwrLVZ3gDe24lv_yP0.jpg"></figure><p><span>月光奏鸣曲一乐章</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiEe5V9VF3kN2aVbQopiHCH3rPlH.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu0SI1TtMa4gqKiodLy88sX4iN4-.png"><p><span>月光第三乐章两种标记的对比</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmQQ63x3R_hE9qRB8MmkrhWjgl00.jpg"></figure><p><span>Op. 10 No.&nbsp;3——“不存在的高八度F音”</span></p><p></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi5PWgAEcIF5mTqv9kOmPaTaPI4J.jpg"></figure><p><span>Tempest 暴风雨第三乐章 311小节</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FplvBC7-_qWu0Ua4luH6I_PX9zcD.jpg"></figure><p><span>Erard（埃拉尔）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRxbf7PaWPyukZBltgbLrbKOG45.jpg"></figure><p><span>华德斯坦</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvyzZlXdnnarifCvovfy1VWUT3-7.jpg"></figure><p><span>响声助手</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-XKprPsv0qLiUsh7FxnC2AbktH.jpg"></figure><p><span>Broadwood（布罗德伍德）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkUME-sUoDyG3vGrb5NfIeU63yy-.jpg"></figure><p><span>Graf（格拉夫）</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
