  <item>
    <title>格伦·古尔德的艺术｜他的十张专辑和制作</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a16b42b7460cabdeb56a40f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a16b42b7460cabdeb56a40f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 09:23:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>古尔德最著名的项目无疑是两版《哥德堡变奏曲》。这期节目，我们通过古尔德的另外十张专辑（或制作/再创作，具体作品参考下方时点），更完整地认识这位颇具争议的角色。</span></p><p><span>相关单集：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fdf20f3d8df2f7e9e620aa" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fdf20f3d8df2f7e9e620aa"><span>与雪原聊哥德堡变奏曲</span></a></p><p><span>本期播放列表：</span><a href="https://music.apple.com/us/playlist/%E6%BB%A1%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%AC/pl.fa3ad3a67389495fb0372b3284beae5c" data-url="https://music.apple.com/us/playlist/%E6%BB%A1%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%AC/pl.fa3ad3a67389495fb0372b3284beae5c"><span>Apple Music</span></a></p><h2><span>本期时点</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 关于</span><strong><span>提醒大家关注响声小红书账号，给响声App打五星</span></strong><span>的广告</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 古尔德一生时间线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 伯德、吉本斯音乐合集 A Consort of Musicke bye William Byrde and Orlando Gibbons</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">23:39</a> 巴赫：意大利协奏曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 勃拉姆斯第一钢琴协奏曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3269">54:29</a> 莫扎特 K.331</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4043">67:23</a> 格里格 钢琴奏鸣曲 Op. 7</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4515">75:15</a> 瓦格纳 《纽伦堡名歌手》钢琴改编（剪辑叠加）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5000">83:20</a> 理查·施特劳斯 《伊诺克·阿登》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6248">104:08</a> 古尔德原创对位广播剧 《孤独三部曲》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7337">122:17</a> 古尔德 So You Want To Write A Fugue</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvmQVBbPwcOo8P4CJsKhm1en3Mlj.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8090">134:50</a> 韦伯恩 钢琴变奏曲 Op. 27</span></p><p><span>满老师资料（大部份在 YouTube，麻烦自行在bilibili搜索关键字）</span></p><p><span>Glenn Gould website：</span><a href="https://glenngould.com" data-url="https://glenngould.com"><span>glenngould.com</span></a></p><p><span>孤独三部曲：</span></p><p><span>《北方的观念》</span><a href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOWmr2m_svcTYE8KI1XYPVqs3E2jpgvbq&amp;si=A8t0AQA3HGfsjQnS" data-url="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOWmr2m_svcTYE8KI1XYPVqs3E2jpgvbq&amp;si=A8t0AQA3HGfsjQnS"><span>youtube.com</span></a></p><p><span>《大地的静谧》</span><a href="https://youtu.be/Ko-NhvQxPI0?si=Zz5x6Xl8PqD4Np0y" data-url="https://youtu.be/Ko-NhvQxPI0?si=Zz5x6Xl8PqD4Np0y"><span>youtu.be</span></a></p><p><span>纪录片Off the record: </span><a href="https://youtu.be/pL9YjM1BqgY?si=iHqA6v60VSCA8_Hb" data-url="https://youtu.be/pL9YjM1BqgY?si=iHqA6v60VSCA8_Hb"><span>youtu.be</span></a></p><p><span>纪录片On the record: </span><a href="https://youtu.be/g0MZrnuSGGg?si=iZejhVKa6nrgndUT" data-url="https://youtu.be/g0MZrnuSGGg?si=iZejhVKa6nrgndUT"><span>youtu.be</span></a></p><p><span>古尔德对着动物唱歌：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=57kR6RsV2iA" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=57kR6RsV2iA"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><p><span>RICHARD STRAUSS, A PERSONAL VIEW &amp; THE ANATOMY OF THE FUGUE:</span><a href="https://youtu.be/9ZC3onaVd7w?si=lEPQQcaFrEf--S9O" data-url="https://youtu.be/9ZC3onaVd7w?si=lEPQQcaFrEf--S9O"><span>youtu.be</span></a></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
