    <title>巴赫《平均律键盘曲集》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a01bdfee1eb34a9392eb122</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a01bdfee1eb34a9392eb122</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 11:48:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《平均律》是最伟大的键盘作品之一。我们和雪原，以及音乐经纪人Herbert（微信公众号 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KbsfVNnnK4xRC2fBIesaUg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KbsfVNnnK4xRC2fBIesaUg"><span>Classical Reflection</span></a><span>）一起聊了聊平均律的概念，我们各自喜爱的几首，乐器和近期相关演出等。</span></p><p><span>请大家关注下列演出</span></p><figure><img></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp5a8efsVvuf8IhsbRHCUE1ale1Q.PNG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fis1d-UmNYP2JJ_aeLTWjURTYfz9.PNG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsgWRa4eAWulTbj9wxe6c42x7JuW.PNG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtfReGrvs0WcSavVd0a1t5X_G-T5.PNG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjnvyXnFGcHamPE--937My4a_wY.PNG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdZwjz84oyfLpWFo6Ph2i6YmSYg.PNG"></figure><h2><span>本期时点 </span></h2><p><span>WTC I=平均律第一本</span></p><p><span>WTC II=平均律第二本</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> WTC II 降B小调 BWV 891 前奏曲（Gould）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> WTC II 升F小调 BWV 883 前奏曲（部分，Edwin Fischer）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> WTC I C大调 BWV 846 前奏曲（John Butt）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> WTC I C大调 BWV 846 赋格（John Butt）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> WTC I C小调 BWV 847 前奏曲（John Butt）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">38:02</a> WTC I C小调 BWV 847 赋格（John Butt）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> WTC I 升C小调 BWV 849 前奏曲（Edwin Fischer）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2813">46:53</a> WTC I 升C小调 BWV 849 赋格（Edwin Fischer）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">58:19</a> WTC I B小调 BWV 869 赋格（Richter）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4123">68:43</a> WTC II 升F小调 BWV 883 赋格（Edwin Fischer）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4347">72:27</a> WTC II 降B小调 BWV 891 赋格（Gould）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5987">99:47</a> WTC I C大调 BWV 846 前奏曲（Leonhardt）</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
